# Assignment 4 – API Test File



# SERVER ROOT


GET http://localhost:3000/



# /media 


### GET all media
GET http://localhost:3000/api/media

### GET media by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/media/1

### POST media (file upload)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/media
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Boundary

------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Test image
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Uploaded with REST client
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="user_id"

1
------Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test-cat.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./test-cat.png
------Boundary--

### PUT media by id
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/media/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated title",
  "description": "Updated description"
}

### DELETE media by id
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/media/3



# /users 


### GET all users
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users

### GET user by id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users/1

### POST new user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newuser",
  "email": "newuser@example.com",
  "password": "pass123"
}

### PUT user by id
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "updateduser",
  "email": "updateduser@example.com"
}

### DELETE user by id
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/users/3


# /likes


### GET likes for media
GET http://localhost:3000/api/likes/media/1

### GET likes for user
GET http://localhost:3000/api/likes/user/1

### POST like
POST http://localhost:3000/api/likes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "media_id": 1
}

### DELETE like
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/likes/1
